id: SCA-042
title: Gemspec with native extensions
category: supply-chain
severity: info
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .gemspec
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
patterns:
  - regex: extensions\s*=.*\[
    message: Gems with native extensions compile C code during install. A malicious extension can execute arbitrary code with the installing user privileges.
fix: Audit gems with native extensions. Prefer pure-Ruby alternatives when available. Review the extconf.rb or Rakefile that compiles the extension.
